WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
A small model on your Mac. Nothing leaves it.

00:03.500 --> 00:09.500
She paints a masterpiece from 30,000 squares

00:09.500 --> 00:18.500
She draws anything you can name

00:18.500 --> 00:22.000
She runs your Mac: volume, music, timers

00:22.000 --> 00:25.000
She does the math

00:25.000 --> 00:28.000
She knows the time anywhere

00:28.000 --> 00:33.000
Private. Free. Honest. Download her.
